        "content": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\nDay 52: Instagram Follower Bot - ASCII Art\n\"\"\"\n\nLOGO = r\"\"\"\n  ___           _          ____       _   \n |_ _|_ __  ___| |_ __ _  | __ )  ___| |_ \n  | || '_ \\/ __| __/ _` | |  _ \\ / _ \\ __|\n  | || | | \\__ \\ || (_| | | |_) | (_) | |_ \n |___|_| |_|___/\\__\\__,_| |____/ \\___/ \\__|\n                                           \n        \ud83d\udcf8 INSTAGRAM ENGAGEMENT & FOLLOWER ENGINE \ud83d\ude80\n\"\"\"\n"
