        "content": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\nDay 54: Introduction to Web Development with Flask & Decorators - ASCII Art\n\"\"\"\n\nLOGO = r\"\"\"\n  _____ _           _       ____                            _                 \n |  ___| | __ _ ___| | __  |  _ \\  ___  ___ ___  _ __ __ _| |_ ___  _ __ ___  \n | |_  | |/ _` / __| |/ /  | | | |/ _ \\/ __/ _ \\| '__/ _` | __/ _ \\| '__/ __| \n |  _| | | (_| \\__ \\   <   | |_| |  __/ (_| (_) | | | (_| | || (_) | |  \\__ \\ \n |_|   |_|\\__,_|___/_|\\_\\  |____/ \\___|\\___\\___/|_|  \\__,_|\\__\\___/|_|  |___/ \n                                                                              \n           \ud83c\udf36\ufe0f PYTHON DECORATORS & FLASK MICROFRAMEWORK \ud83c\udf10\n\"\"\"\n"
