        "content": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\nDay 73: Aggregate & Merge Data with Pandas - ASCII Art & Banners\n\"\"\"\n\nLOGO = r\"\"\"\n  _     _____ ____  ___    ____        _        \n | |   | ____/ ___|/ _ \\  |  _ \\  __ _| |_ __ _ \n | |   |  _|| |  _| | | | | | | |/ _` | __/ _` |\n | |___| |__| |_| | |_| | | |_| | (_| | || (_| |\n |_____|_____\\____|\\___/  |____/ \\__,_|\\__\\__,_|\n                                                \n    \ud83e\uddf1 LEGO HISTORICAL DATABASE, MERGES & AGGREGATIONS \ud83c\udff0\n\"\"\"\n"
