        "content": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\nDay 83: Tic Tac Toe Python Game with AI - ASCII Art & Banners\n\"\"\"\n\nLOGO = r\"\"\"\n  _____ _        _____           _____          \n |_   _(_) ___  |_   _|_ _  ___ |_   _|__   ___ \n   | | | |/ __|   | |/ _` |/ __|  | |/ _ \\ / _ \\\n   | | | | (__    | | (_| | (__   | | (_) |  __/\n   |_| |_|\\___|   |_|\\__,_|\\___|  |_|\\___/ \\___|\n                                                \n    \u2694\ufe0f UNBEATABLE MINIMAX AI & TERMINAL GRID ARENA \ud83e\udd16\n\"\"\"\n"
