        "name": "art.py",
        "content": "\"\"\"\nDay 99: Public Data Analysis & Interactive Web Dashboard - ASCII Art & UI Accents\n\"\"\"\n\nLOGO = r\"\"\"\n  ____    _  _____  _      ____    _    ____  _   _ \n |  _ \\  / \\|_   _|/ \\    |  _ \\  / \\  / ___|| | | |\n | | | |/ _ \\ | | / _ \\   | | | |/ _ \\ \\___ \\| |_| |\n | |_| / ___ \\| |/ ___ \\  | |_| / ___ \\ ___) |  _  |\n |____/_/   \\_\\_/_/   \\_\\ |____/_/   \\_\\____/|_| |_|\n         [ Interactive Public Intelligence & KPI Dashboard ]\n\"\"\"\n\nDASHBOARD_ICON = r\"\"\"\n   +--------------------+--------------------+\n   | [\ud83c\udf10 GLOBAL DEVS]   | [\ud83d\udcc8 MEDIAN GDP]    |\n   |    28.7 MILLION    |     $34,250        |\n   +--------------------+--------------------+\n   | [\u26a1 INTERNET PEN]   | [\ud83d\ude80 TECH EXPORTS]  |\n   |       84.6%        |     $1,850 B       |\n   +--------------------+--------------------+\n\"\"\"\n"
